-	 * successor this bound exists for, so this stops on it at once
-	 * rather than after another minute of asking.
+	 * a count of seconds here. A holder that is gone stops moving its
+	 * expiry, so a frozen one is waited out however far out it is, which
+	 * is five minutes when the predecessor died with its project idle. A
+	 * holder that is alive pushes it forward every renewal, and one that
+	 * keeps advancing for ZOU_LEASE_MOVING_SECS is the successor this
